00:24:27.032 --> 00:24:28.233
It's not that at all.

00:24:28.233 --> 00:24:31.102 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's that you are a
word that speaks, Dave.

00:24:31.102 --> 00:24:33.405
And that, that Dave is an
