00:24:49.054 --> 00:24:50.555
It's incredibly liberating.

00:24:50.555 --> 00:24:54.059 align:start position:0%
It is an incredibly
liberating, joyful way to live.

00:24:54.059 --> 00:24:55.527
And when I say joy,

00:24:55.527 --> 00:24:56.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
