around happy all the time.

00:24:56.328 --> 00:24:57.562
That would be crazy.

00:24:57.562 --> 00:24:59.664
But I mean, as you live
life with a new gusto

00:24:59.664 --> 00:25:02.033 align:start size:84% position:16%
