00:25:19.618 --> 00:25:20.552
And it's the creation of you.

00:25:20.552 --> 00:25:22.087
It's creation of your soul

00:25:22.087 --> 00:25:23.955
becoming more and more of
what it's supposed to be.

00:25:23.955 --> 00:25:27.125
So yes, to go back
to what you said,

00:25:27.125 --> 00:25:30.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just totally agree that
when I see these guys

